<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60285" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρύψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκρύπτω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hiding, concealment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυφθῆναι κρύψιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					955
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.46.3
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσις</span>, of stars,
				<i>disappearance</i> below the horizon, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				13.2
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				97b
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>occultation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theo Sm.
				p.192
			</span></i> H. (pl.); <i>heliacal setting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				831.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.137
			</span></i> H.; of new moon, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; <i>disappearance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.366d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>suppression</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμηνίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.495
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>concealment</i> of stolen goods, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1372a32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>mystery, secret</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρύψιν μεγάλην ἀνυμνοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					52b
				</span></i>
			is.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
